      "description": "App bridge commands reachable from the loopback desktop renderer origin. The production renderer is served over http://127.0.0.1 (asset_server.rs), which Tauri treats as a REMOTE context — custom commands are denied unless an app permission explicitly allows them (webview/mod.rs ACL check). Every command registered in lib.rs invoke_handler must be mirrored here.",
